# CODEOWNERS -- Defines who must review PRs for each area.
#
# OpenAgri maintainers have review authority over the threat catalog,
# fuzzy risk engine, and biological parameters they created.
# AgStack core maintainers review foundation, infrastructure, and CI/CD.
#
# GitHub requires at least one approving review from a CODEOWNER
# before a PR can be merged (when branch protection is enabled).

